[img]https://cdn.venworkscreations.com/NexusMods/description-divider-installation-instructions-1600x120.png[/img]
[size=3][b][u]Via Vortex/MO2[/u][/b][/size]
Install as normally would any mod.
[size=3][b]Installation Manually[/b][/size]
Really please use a mod manager :) Download the current zip file. Please everything in the Data folder in the zip to the same place under <Game Install Dir aka where starfield.exe is>\Data.

